  "description": "Na-Ji, known throughout the industry as the ‘Legendary Developer,’ is a notorious workaholic who routinely overworks himself until his herniated disc finally gives out. Amidst this, he ends up attending a colleague's birthday party at a gay club for the first time in his life. There, he meets Ki Sung-Geun, a man dubbed the ‘Legendary Healer,’ and spends the night with him... The next day. More surprising than sleeping with a stranger was the fact that his aching back had miraculously healed! He needs this man, Ki Sung-Gun, to meet tomorrow's deadline.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
